            "text": "<p>From the smallest trick, to solving challenging behaviors, our certified force-free dog trainers are here to help you and your pup succeed.</p><p>Potty Training</p><p>General Obedience</p><p>New Puppy Fundamentals</p><p>Crate Training</p><p>Separation Anxiety</p><p>Reactivity and Aggression</p><p>& More</p>"
