            "text": "<p>Whether your puppy isn't old enough for socialization or you have a dog with a bit of extra personality, virtual training can be a lot <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">less frightening than an unfamiliar environment</span> with unknown people and dogs. By training in your dog’s “safe space”, you are making the process less overwhelming for them (and you!) </p>",
