          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "support",
            "title": "1. Evaluate your pup",
            "text": "<p>Your initial call will help understand your challenges and develop a plan with actionable tips.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16036805083322__bf09f991-7e3a-4cff-b515-3225a6d06b60-1677079215bbc5ef89-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "calendar",
            "title": "2. Get matched with your expert",
            "text": "<p>We'll then schedule your 1-on-1 session with a certified expert who is the best fit for you and your dog.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16036805083322__bf09f991-7e3a-4cff-b515-3225a6d06b60-1677079215bbc5ef89-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "award",
            "title": "3. Learn from the best of the best.",
            "text": "<p>Your dedicated expert will work directly  with you and your dog in a live session. This is where the fun begins!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
